  "notes": "Full recipe recovered from the primary literature: base medium 'Anoxic (NC10-type) mineral medium' (Recipe chains through two citations. PMC10811727 cites ref 16 = Wu M, et al. 'Anaerobic oxidation of propane coupled to nitrate reduction by a lineage within the class Symbiobacteriia' Nat Commun 2022;13:6115, DOI 10.1038/s41467-022-33872-y (PMC9576796). That paper defines its 'anoxic synthetic medium' by citing Ettwig KF, van Alen T, van de Pas-Schoonen KT, Jetten MSM, Strous M. 'Enrichment and M",
  "verification": "paper-verified (complete recipe; cited + supplementary sources chased)",
  "verification_evidence": "The mineral medium contained (per liter): 0.5-1.5 g KHCO3 (added as required to maintain denitrifying activity), 0.05 g KH2PO4, 0.3 g CaCl2.2H2O, 0.2 g MgSO4.7H2O, 0.425 g NaNO3 (5 mM).",
  "verification_confidence": "low",
  "recipe_evidence": "PMC10811727 Methods: 'An anoxic mineral medium [16] of 0.67 and 1.69 l was initially added to the ethane and butane reactor ... The ethane/butane reactors were periodically flushed with pure ethane/butane gas (99.99%, Coregas, Australia) to maintain the ethane/butane partial pressure in the headspace between 0.9 and 1.2 atm. A concentrated stock solution (80 g NO3-N l-1) was manually pulse-fed to the reactors to replenish NO3- to 20-30 mg N l-1.' Ref 16 (Wu 2022) states the medium was 'anoxic synthetic medium prepared as described previously [45]' = Ettwig et al. 2009. Ettwig 2009 verbatim: 'T",
  "recipe_confidence": "high",
  "base_medium": "Anoxic NC10-type mineral medium (Ettwig et al. 2009, AEM), cited via ref 16 (Wu et al. 2022, Nat Commun, PMC9576796)",
  "base_medium_reference": "Recipe chains through two citations. PMC10811727 cites ref 16 = Wu M, et al. 'Anaerobic oxidation of propane coupled to nitrate reduction by a lineage within the class Symbiobacteriia' Nat Commun 2022;13:6115, DOI 10.1038/s41467-022-33872-y (PMC9576796). That paper defines its 'anoxic synthetic medium' by citing Ettwig KF, van Alen T, van de Pas-Schoonen KT, Jetten MSM, Strous M. 'Enrichment and Molecular Detection of Denitrifying Methanotrophic Bacteria of the NC10 Phylum' Appl Environ Microbiol 2009;75(11):3656-3662, DOI 10.1128/AEM.00067-09 (PMC2687271), which gives the full composition.",
  "recuration": {
   "date": "2026-07-16",
