   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "The paper gives only the modification (nitrate + ethane) and cites the medium as ref 16; ref 16 in turn cites Ettwig 2009, which supplies the complete NC10 mineral medium. All conc_mM values already in the target match Ettwig 2009 exactly, but tungsten (Na2WO4) was entirely absent from the target and boron, selenium, bicarbonate and ethane were unmapped. No vitamins or added chemical reductant (cysteine/sulfide) are part of this medium; anoxia is maintained by inert gas/substrate sparging and the nitrate serves as electron acceptor."
  },
